<title>FRANCE: Alcatel rallies after losing Thomson bid.</title>
<headline>Alcatel rallies after losing Thomson bid.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-10-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in Alcatel Alsthom rallied more than three percent in early trading on Wednesday after the French government said it preferred a rival bid for electronics group Thomson SA from Lagardere Groupe.</p>
<p>Alcatel shares were up 3.84 percent at 462 francs at 0840 GMT. Lagardere shares were suspended in early trading.</p>
</text>
